WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.920
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:02.920 --> 00:04.650
<i>Wow! A gift for you!</i>

00:04.650 --> 00:06.520
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:11.930 --> 00:13.710
<i>Nothing happening,</i>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.910
<i>every day feels the same</i>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
<i>Over and over, just</i>

00:17.320 --> 00:19.400
<i>waiting for time to pass</i>

00:19.400 --> 00:21.420
<i>When I'm with you,</i>

00:21.420 --> 00:22.620
<i>I can feel</i>

00:22.620 --> 00:24.750
<i>something so special,</i>

00:24.750 --> 00:27.880
<i>and I want to make it real</i>

00:27.880 --> 00:30.380
<i>Look, I'm really grateful every day, but you know</i>

00:30.380 --> 00:32.270
<i>I feel like I'm not doing enough in return</i>

00:32.270 --> 00:33.920
<i>"I was just feeling like it.</i>

00:33.920 --> 00:35.720
<i>No real meaning or reason why."</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:40.110
<i>Stop complaining and just take it already!</i>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
<i>(Isn't that maybe how love's defined?)</i>

00:40.960 --> 00:43.520
<i>Yeah, there's no way that's how it goes!</i>

00:42.680 --> 00:44.350
<i>(So, isn't that true love defined?)</i>

00:44.350 --> 00:46.360
<i>Whoa oh oh oh oh</i>

00:46.360 --> 00:48.810
<i>An angel just landed</i>

00:48.810 --> 00:50.700
<i>Right in front of me</i>

00:50.700 --> 00:52.320
<i>With a smile that looked</i>

00:52.320 --> 00:53.990
<i>Like her wings spreading open</i>

00:53.990 --> 00:55.950
<i>Hey, that's against all the rules</i>

00:55.950 --> 00:57.360
<i>You look so happy</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>Wipe off that look</i>

00:59.290 --> 01:01.180
<i>Before my mind goes blank</i>

01:01.180 --> 01:03.020
<i>If you keep this up,</i>

01:03.020 --> 01:05.640
<i>You're gonna spoil me rotten</i>

01:06.460 --> 01:09.760
<i>Come on, you gotta do something about this</i>

01:08.220 --> 01:10.480
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:10.480 --> 01:11.610
<i>I want to know</i>

01:11.610 --> 01:13.640
<i>A lot more about</i>

01:13.640 --> 01:15.680
<i>The world you live in</i>

01:15.680 --> 01:17.880
<i>So, let's get started</i>

01:17.880 --> 01:18.910
<i>I want to laugh</i>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.890
<i>A lot more with you</i>

01:20.890 --> 01:23.050
<i>In the world you live in</i>

01:22.350 --> 01:26.640
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

01:23.050 --> 01:25.020
<i>I want to know more</i>

01:25.020 --> 01:27.690
<i>I want to laugh more</i>

01:29.980 --> 01:33.880
<b>Seijo High School</b>

01:31.190 --> 01:33.540
Look, look! 
The grade rankings are out!

01:33.540 --> 01:36.570
The top 30 is out of our reach, man.

01:36.570 --> 01:38.800
Aww, not again!

01:36.990 --> 01:39.490
<b>Amane Fujimiya                 837 pts.</b>

01:41.020 --> 01:43.780
You made sixth place this time, Fujimiya-san.

01:43.780 --> 01:46.160
Looks like it. I did all right.

01:47.550 --> 01:51.590
Since you worked so hard, 
perhaps you should give yourself a reward.

01:52.930 --> 01:57.590
If you get within the top ten, Amane-kun, 
I'll do anything you ask me to.

01:58.540 --> 02:00.260
Yeah, I guess.

02:01.330 --> 02:03.970
And you got first place. Congrats.

02:01.850 --> 02:07.730
<b>Second Year</b>

02:01.850 --> 02:07.730
<b>Combined 9-subject test scores for first term midterms</b>

02:01.850 --> 02:07.730
<b>Mahiru Shiina      887 pts.</b>

02:04.470 --> 02:07.730
Shouldn't you be the one 
giving yourself a reward, Shiina?

02:07.730 --> 02:08.980
I suppose so.

02:09.670 --> 02:12.610
But I don't want to spoil myself too much.

02:16.140 --> 02:18.730
Huh? A reward for me?

02:18.730 --> 02:21.820
Yeah. Is there anything 
you want, or want me to do?

02:21.820 --> 02:23.620
Want you to do?

02:25.260 --> 02:26.450
Let's see.

02:26.990 --> 02:31.080
Maybe you could use the slicer 
to chop up that cucumber.

02:31.350 --> 02:33.350
I don't mean like that.

02:33.350 --> 02:35.880
You worked really hard, too, 
so something to celebrate that—

02:35.880 --> 02:38.550
And after that, rub salt into the slices.

02:38.550 --> 02:39.350
Got it.

02:41.970 --> 02:43.550
There's really nothing else?

02:44.100 --> 02:48.150
Really nothing. I'm quite satisfied 
with the way things are now.

02:50.000 --> 02:56.190
I think my one true wish is something 
I'll have to grant for myself anyway.

02:56.540 --> 02:58.820
Your one true wish?

02:58.820 --> 03:00.110
What do you think it is?

03:01.660 --> 03:03.690
I-I don't know.

03:03.690 --> 03:05.160
Of course you don't.

03:05.160 --> 03:06.710
So it's fine.

03:07.120 --> 03:09.040
Things are fine like this.

03:11.280 --> 03:11.920
Okay.

03:14.530 --> 03:16.180
All ready, Amane-kun.

03:16.750 --> 03:18.130
Wait. Um...

03:22.720 --> 03:25.510
I don't have to do it if you don't want me to,

03:25.510 --> 03:27.390
but you're the one who asked for this.

03:27.390 --> 03:30.310
I-I do want you to,

03:30.310 --> 03:34.870
but now that I'm looking at it, 
I'm having second thoughts, so...

03:34.870 --> 03:36.980
Then why did you ask for it?

03:37.260 --> 03:40.690
I guess it was just... m-my male instincts.

03:40.690 --> 03:44.280
It's perfectly fine with me 
if you follow those instincts.

03:44.710 --> 03:48.660
This is a reward for your hard work. 
Why not just enjoy it?

03:50.720 --> 03:53.170
I'll pamper you a whole bunch.

04:07.510 --> 04:09.400
I'm gonna clean your ear, okay?

04:12.220 --> 04:14.050
Please hold still, okay?

04:23.850 --> 04:25.320
Does it hurt?

04:25.320 --> 04:28.180
No, it doesn't. It feels good.

04:28.180 --> 04:30.540
Does it? That's good.

04:31.140 --> 04:33.910
I hear that men find this romantic.

04:33.910 --> 04:35.790
Do you find it romantic?

04:36.380 --> 04:37.130
I guess.

04:37.870 --> 04:39.840
You are a boy, after all.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.560
What else would I be?

04:43.920 --> 04:46.580
All right, Amane-kun. Turn over.

04:46.580 --> 04:47.220
Okay.

04:48.830 --> 04:51.770
<i>Hold it right there! If I turn this way...!</i>

04:52.120 --> 04:54.740
Amane-kun? Is something wrong?

04:54.740 --> 04:56.200
Don't worry about it.

04:57.970 --> 05:01.740
Amane-kun, may I play 
with your hair when I'm done?

05:01.740 --> 05:03.300
Do whatever you want.

05:03.300 --> 05:04.030
Okay.

05:07.950 --> 05:09.990
Okay, I'm all done.

05:16.700 --> 05:19.380
<i>Ugh, she's spoiling me again.</i>

05:22.420 --> 05:24.510
You're quite obedient for a change.

05:24.910 --> 05:26.390
Yeah, who's fault is that?

05:26.390 --> 05:27.970
It must be mine.

05:28.880 --> 05:33.290
I always feel like pampering 
and touching you.

05:33.290 --> 05:36.560
Your hair feels really nice, you know.

05:37.060 --> 05:38.380
Does it?

05:38.380 --> 05:40.730
I always thought your hair was really soft.

05:41.220 --> 05:43.640
And it looks like you take good care of it.

05:43.640 --> 05:46.690
But I know I always touch it 
without permission. Is that okay?

05:47.420 --> 05:49.820
I like it when you touch me.

05:51.660 --> 05:54.540
<i>And then I get ideas because
 you say things like that!</i>

06:08.290 --> 06:08.840
Hmm?

06:12.640 --> 06:14.460
Let her guard down again.

06:17.100 --> 06:18.600
Mahiru, wake up.

06:21.440 --> 06:24.420
<i>I feel like I've been here before.</i>

06:25.050 --> 06:25.820
Man...

06:34.140 --> 06:36.080
<i>You're so oblivious.</i>

06:38.420 --> 06:40.710
Things would be so much easier 
if I could say I like you.

06:41.850 --> 06:44.920
Mahiru, wake up! It's time to go home.

06:45.300 --> 06:46.470
Hmm?

06:46.470 --> 06:49.020
No, not "hmm." It's "mm-hmm."

06:49.020 --> 06:49.760
Mm-hmm.

06:49.760 --> 06:50.480
Whoa!

06:52.180 --> 06:53.430
Smells so good.

06:53.430 --> 06:55.440
<i>I don't believe this girl.</i>

06:57.610 --> 07:00.500
Mahiru! It's late. Let's get you home.

07:00.500 --> 07:04.040
We have school tomorrow. 
You don't want to oversleep.

07:04.040 --> 07:05.480
I'll take you to your front door.

07:06.240 --> 07:07.110
Hmm.

07:10.030 --> 07:11.840
Goo nigh—

07:14.160 --> 07:15.880
<i>I don't have a choice.</i>

07:15.880 --> 07:20.650
Mahiru, you're completely out, 
so I'll take you to your room.

07:20.650 --> 07:21.790
Can I borrow your key?

07:22.580 --> 07:23.520
Hmm...

07:24.000 --> 07:25.880
<b>Shiina</b>

07:26.850 --> 07:28.200
Excuse me.

07:38.030 --> 07:40.140
<i>So this is Mahiru's bedroom.</i>

07:42.600 --> 07:44.610
<b>Cooking
Pasta
Recipes
Recipes: Western Dishes
Recipes: Japanese Dishes
French
The Basics</b>

07:58.870 --> 08:02.960
You're home now. 
Don't worry, I'll return your key.

08:04.630 --> 08:06.190
Amane-kun, c'mere.

08:06.190 --> 08:06.840
Huh?!

08:10.450 --> 08:12.950
<i>Think pure thoughts! Think pure thoughts!</i>

08:14.850 --> 08:17.280
I'm going home now, okay?

08:18.400 --> 08:19.310
No.

08:24.060 --> 08:29.230
This fellow says he'll keep you company 
instead, so relax and go to sleep.

08:29.230 --> 08:31.080
Mm-hmm.

08:39.380 --> 08:41.830
<i>She's so defenseless it scares me.</i>

08:41.830 --> 08:44.210
Fujimiya

08:42.650 --> 08:44.620
G-Good morning!

08:44.620 --> 08:45.620
M-Morning.

08:45.620 --> 08:47.080
It's still early. What's up?

08:47.530 --> 08:50.440
Oh, right. You came to get your key back.

08:50.440 --> 08:52.970
Sorry I took it with me last night. 
I'll go get it.

08:52.970 --> 08:56.220
Ah! Um, yes, of course...

08:56.220 --> 08:57.820
But that isn't why I'm here.

08:57.820 --> 08:58.550
Huh?

08:59.490 --> 09:00.430
Here's your key.

09:00.970 --> 09:02.920
Thank you very much.

09:02.920 --> 09:06.010
Um, may I ask you something?

09:06.010 --> 09:06.980
Sure.

09:06.980 --> 09:10.660
There was a framed picture on my desk.

09:10.660 --> 09:12.150
A picture?

09:14.280 --> 09:17.540
I don't think I saw it. Did something happen?

09:17.540 --> 09:19.120
Oh, did I knock it over or something?

09:19.120 --> 09:20.900
N-No, you didn't!

09:20.900 --> 09:24.040
It's fine if you didn't see it. 
If you... didn't see it.

09:24.470 --> 09:27.030
I tried not to look around too much.

09:27.030 --> 09:31.000
All I saw was the stuffed animals 
I gave you, all lined up...

09:31.380 --> 09:36.220
And the stuffed bear by your pillow 
that I guess you sleep with.

09:37.200 --> 09:39.640
Please ignore that! 
It's none of your business!

09:39.910 --> 09:42.740
Yeah, but you're the one who told me.

09:42.740 --> 09:45.810
Do you mean I was sleeping 
with the bear because...?

09:46.100 --> 09:49.410
You were half asleep and asked me 
to sleep next to you!

09:49.820 --> 09:51.230
A-And that wasn't gonna happen, so...

09:51.530 --> 09:52.440
Sleep next to me?!

09:52.440 --> 09:55.690
D-Did I really say that?

09:55.690 --> 09:58.110
Well, not exactly.

09:58.110 --> 10:01.160
But you called my name and patted the bed.

10:04.410 --> 10:08.200
Y-You've got it all wrong! I never 
ever think about doing that with you!

10:08.200 --> 10:09.710
Nnn-nnn... N-Never!

10:10.120 --> 10:11.240
Oh.

10:11.240 --> 10:14.880
It's just, I just feel 
really relaxed around you.

10:14.880 --> 10:18.050
I-It's not like I have weird 
desires or anything!

10:18.050 --> 10:23.100
L-Like physical desires! 
It isn't like... It isn't like that at all!

10:23.400 --> 10:24.600
What are you talking about?

10:25.490 --> 10:27.480
Please, don't ask any more!

10:28.540 --> 10:31.220
Yeah... well, be careful next time, okay?

10:31.220 --> 10:33.510
I know we're close friends and all that,

10:33.510 --> 10:35.940
but that doesn't mean I can just sleep over.

10:37.130 --> 10:38.250
Heh.

10:38.250 --> 10:43.120
Even though you have no problem falling 
asleep in my lap all the time, Amane-kun?

10:43.900 --> 10:46.470
Th-That's totally different!

10:46.470 --> 10:49.260
Even though <i>I</i> might do something to <i>you</i>?

10:49.260 --> 10:50.940
Would you really do something?

10:50.940 --> 10:52.330
Good question.

10:52.730 --> 10:55.380
Maybe I'd take prank photos of you sleeping.

10:55.380 --> 10:58.090
That does sound like you. Please don't.

10:58.340 --> 11:02.500
And you and I are talking about 
"doing" totally different things.

11:02.500 --> 11:04.100
Just don't tempt me, okay?

11:04.100 --> 11:06.430
I understand fully, so don't worry.

11:06.430 --> 11:08.430
You don't get it. Not at all.

11:08.780 --> 11:11.160
I do get it! Rude.

11:11.160 --> 11:13.440
I think you underestimate me, mister.

11:13.440 --> 11:16.300
If you got it, 
you wouldn't do stuff like that.

11:16.300 --> 11:18.650
You still aren't keeping up, Amane-kun.

11:19.600 --> 11:22.530
You should try a little harder 
to pay attention.

11:27.470 --> 11:30.000
And she thinks <i>I</i> don't get it?

11:30.040 --> 11:35.000
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

11:35.000 --> 11:37.250
<b>Seijo High School</b>

11:37.250 --> 11:38.950
Go for it!

11:38.950 --> 11:40.380
Kadowaki-kun!

11:42.180 --> 11:43.450
Nice shot!

11:43.450 --> 11:44.090
Thanks.

11:44.090 --> 11:46.630
All right, looks like we're up.

11:46.630 --> 11:49.350
How can you exercise 
like this when it's so hot?

11:49.350 --> 11:50.730
Ikkun!

11:50.730 --> 11:52.440
Fight!

11:52.440 --> 11:55.170
I know you'll take first place, Ikkun!

11:53.080 --> 11:54.270
Good luck.

11:55.170 --> 11:56.570
Unleash the beast!

11:55.810 --> 11:57.630
Feel like exercising now?

11:56.960 --> 11:59.650
Ikkun! Fight!

11:58.860 --> 11:59.650
Shut up.

11:59.930 --> 12:01.360
Go for it!

12:01.360 --> 12:03.360
Fujimiya

12:08.530 --> 12:09.700
Good morning.

12:09.700 --> 12:11.290
Morning.

12:11.290 --> 12:14.840
I fully realize how brash it is 
for me to come calling so early,

12:14.840 --> 12:18.290
but I hoped to check something 
with you before we leave.

12:18.290 --> 12:19.090
Check something?

12:19.630 --> 12:23.190
I changed into summer clothes. 
Does anything look odd to you?

12:23.190 --> 12:26.170
Oh, summer clothes.

12:26.170 --> 12:27.550
Ah! Yeah, I mean...

12:27.550 --> 12:28.600
Yes?

12:31.130 --> 12:33.750
Perhaps the bare legs 
are not such a good idea.

12:34.440 --> 12:38.270
Most of the girls at school 
aren't wearing tights either.

12:38.270 --> 12:42.160
Well yeah, but... 
You shouldn't go out like that, Mahiru.

12:43.070 --> 12:44.260
You really shouldn't.

12:44.740 --> 12:47.820
Are you saying you can't stand 
the sight of my legs?

12:47.820 --> 12:49.730
Yeah, no, I'm not.

12:49.730 --> 12:52.650
I just don't think you should 
show them off so easily.

12:52.650 --> 12:54.540
All the guys are gonna 
start drooling over you.

12:55.080 --> 12:57.420
And you won't, Amane-kun?

12:58.570 --> 13:00.340
That's a little more than "brash," you know.

13:00.710 --> 13:02.920
You saw them when I sprained my foot, right?

13:03.270 --> 13:05.220
That was an emergency.

13:06.190 --> 13:10.470
I didn't have any dirty thoughts at all. 
I even covered you up with my jacket.

13:10.820 --> 13:13.440
Does that mean you're 
having dirty thoughts now?

13:13.970 --> 13:15.250
N-No.

13:15.250 --> 13:17.520
That tone doesn't really inspire confidence.

13:18.060 --> 13:19.380
I said no!

13:20.930 --> 13:23.410
Oh, don't take it so seriously.

13:23.410 --> 13:25.070
I'm sorry for teasing you so much.

13:25.750 --> 13:29.660
You don't need to worry. 
I also brought stockings with me.

13:29.660 --> 13:30.500
Huh?

13:31.290 --> 13:32.990
Oh, come on.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.590
So you didn't mind if <i>I</i> saw them?

13:35.590 --> 13:36.250
Huh?

13:36.750 --> 13:39.890
Did you go out of your way 
to show me your bare legs

13:39.890 --> 13:41.800
because you didn't mind if I saw them?

13:43.170 --> 13:47.090
Well, that's... if you see them...

13:47.590 --> 13:49.250
You don't even care?

13:49.250 --> 13:53.430
I wouldn't say... that I don't care, exactly...

13:53.430 --> 13:57.730
In that case, don't show me. 
Only show it to people you want to see.

14:00.570 --> 14:04.780
Wh-What if I said I really did want to show you?

14:07.090 --> 14:09.760
I wanted to see how you'd react, Amane-kun.

14:10.280 --> 14:12.870
All you did was tell me "no," though.

14:13.240 --> 14:19.130
W-Well, of course I did. 
I mean, well, it's kind of risky.

14:19.560 --> 14:22.090
Like, where am I supposed to look?

14:22.090 --> 14:23.750
You don't think this looks good on me?

14:26.400 --> 14:29.550
It's really cute. I think you look great.

14:29.930 --> 14:32.660
So would you please 
put your stockings on now?

14:32.660 --> 14:33.390
Huh?

14:36.570 --> 14:37.390
Sure.

14:38.170 --> 14:43.110
I'm glad I got to show you my summer 
clothes before anyone else, Amane-kun.

14:45.490 --> 14:48.650
Ooh, Mahirun! You're wearing 
summer clothes today!

14:48.650 --> 14:49.650
Yes.

14:49.650 --> 14:52.170
It's so hot, right? I'm jealous.

14:52.170 --> 14:52.740
Oh, hey.

14:52.740 --> 14:55.570
Next day off, you wanna go shopping 
for summer clothes together?

14:55.090 --> 14:57.040
Are we feeling a little grumpy today?

14:55.570 --> 14:57.040
Sure, that sounds fun.

14:57.040 --> 14:57.970
All right!

14:57.330 --> 14:58.870
You're imagining it.

14:57.970 --> 14:59.250
Where shall we go?

15:00.130 --> 15:02.460
Ikkun! Let's walk home together.

15:02.840 --> 15:06.950
Okay, guys, we're off 
on a good-job-no-study date!

15:07.740 --> 15:08.820
Let's go.

15:08.820 --> 15:10.600
Yeah! So, so, where to?

15:10.600 --> 15:13.140
Hey, you know that movie 
you wanted to see?

15:11.070 --> 15:14.680
You wanna hang out somewhere, too? 
There's no club today.

15:13.140 --> 15:14.680
It'll be ending soon.

15:14.680 --> 15:16.600
Yes, please!

15:14.680 --> 15:16.600
Sure, why not?

15:21.380 --> 15:22.600
What are you doing, Shiina?

15:22.920 --> 15:25.590
I have print-outs for sports day.

15:25.590 --> 15:30.610
The teacher asked me to 
staple them together if I have time.

15:30.610 --> 15:33.920
Sorry, Kadowaki. Can we go another time?

15:33.920 --> 15:36.910
What a coincidence. 
I was thinking the same thing.

15:40.120 --> 15:41.790
<b>Things to Remember for Sports Day</b>

15:40.870 --> 15:42.340
That's the last one.

15:42.340 --> 15:45.540
I didn't mean to steal your time like this.

15:45.930 --> 15:49.300
You didn't steal it. We spent it willingly.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.470
Dummy.

15:54.220 --> 15:57.890
When she isn't brown-nosing with 
teachers, she's showing off to the boys.

15:57.890 --> 16:00.230
She goes on and on about her "dear" friend

16:00.230 --> 16:01.980
and then starts flirting with all the guys?

16:01.980 --> 16:04.900
Totally. She sure gets around.

16:11.450 --> 16:14.490
Are you upset about 
what those girls said at school?

16:14.490 --> 16:16.160
Of course I am.

16:16.580 --> 16:19.360
As far as I'm concerned, it isn't a big deal.

16:19.780 --> 16:24.080
I expected that much. 
It would be stranger if they didn't talk.

16:24.080 --> 16:26.150
That's how you see it?

16:26.150 --> 16:27.750
Of course.

16:27.750 --> 16:30.980
It's not as if I expect 
to be universally liked.

16:31.380 --> 16:33.680
Someone who was would 
actually be kind of scary.

16:34.440 --> 16:40.310
Especially among the girls... 
Some of them don't like me one bit.

16:40.890 --> 16:43.100
The only reason they don't say so in public

16:43.100 --> 16:47.270
is because the majority 
holds me in high regard.

16:47.570 --> 16:51.280
It's easier to get along if you 
don't challenge the majority.

16:51.610 --> 16:53.170
Isn't that tough for you?

16:53.170 --> 16:56.180
I probably wouldn't like it 
if they said it to my face,

16:56.180 --> 17:00.280
but when I hear people talk 
about how they hate me, like today,

17:00.280 --> 17:01.790
I know they don't hate me as a person.

17:02.280 --> 17:06.000
They just dislike my appearance 
and my position in class.

17:07.170 --> 17:10.340
Well, for the ones interested in Kadowaki,

17:10.340 --> 17:12.340
they probably think you might steal him.

17:13.170 --> 17:17.090
I mean, any normal guy would fall head 
over heels the first time you talked to him.

17:17.680 --> 17:21.420
I suppose you aren't any 
normal guy, then, Amane-kun.

17:21.920 --> 17:22.970
I dunno.

17:25.810 --> 17:30.390
Regardless, Kadowaki-san 
isn't my type to begin with.

17:30.390 --> 17:31.860
How should I put this...

17:33.200 --> 17:36.240
Maybe because we sort of have 
a similar role in class,

17:36.240 --> 17:39.280
it doesn't feel like we could develop 
any feelings for each other.

17:39.620 --> 17:44.130
Well, you two do seem 
kind of similar in public, I guess.

17:44.130 --> 17:46.880
Kadowaki doesn't have a private
 persona like you do, though.

17:47.750 --> 17:51.130
You make it sound like I have 
multiple personalities or something!

17:51.810 --> 17:53.880
Do I really act that differently?

17:53.880 --> 17:56.770
Well, different might not be the right word,

17:56.770 --> 18:01.470
but I do think the real Mahiru is 
way cuter than the angel.

18:02.310 --> 18:05.960
At first you acted really icy and strict,

18:07.110 --> 18:10.390
but once you opened up a little, 
you were honest, even awkward sometimes.

18:10.810 --> 18:12.360
It made a nice contrast.

18:14.360 --> 18:17.720
W-Well who do you think makes it 
awkward in the first place?!

18:17.720 --> 18:21.270
Yeah, well, I don't do it on purpose.

18:21.270 --> 18:24.540
It's even worse if you 
aren't doing it on purpose.

18:25.030 --> 18:28.150
I could say the exact same thing 
about you, though.

18:28.150 --> 18:30.440
In fact, you're way worse.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.710
What does that mean?

18:32.160 --> 18:35.510
You keep getting physical with me 
without even thinking about it,

18:35.510 --> 18:36.900
so that's one thing.

18:38.020 --> 18:40.070
I-I don't do it on purpose!

18:40.070 --> 18:42.890
I mean, I <i>do</i> do it on purpose 
sometimes, but it isn't on purpose!

18:43.490 --> 18:45.800
I know you usually don't mean it.

18:45.800 --> 18:50.190
But if a girl acts like that too much, 
it sends the wrong message. Be careful.

18:50.570 --> 18:52.650
But I'm only like that with you, Amane-kun.

18:52.650 --> 18:55.320
I know that. That's what I'm telling you.

18:58.330 --> 18:59.860
See? This is exactly what I mean.

19:00.380 --> 19:02.070
This one is intentional.

19:02.070 --> 19:03.150
Uh...

19:05.450 --> 19:09.050
I know this contradicts what I said before,

19:09.050 --> 19:14.380
but I try to be a good girl, 
like an angel, to make everyone like me.

19:14.380 --> 19:19.190
But I've started to 
get tired of that recently.

19:19.190 --> 19:20.340
Tired of it?

19:20.950 --> 19:23.760
I don't need to act good all the time.

19:24.570 --> 19:28.330
As long as I have someone 
who sees me as I really am,

19:28.330 --> 19:31.150
I think I'd rather just be myself.

19:33.800 --> 19:38.030
You kept on watching me, right, Amane-kun?

19:40.400 --> 19:42.650
Then can I ask you a favor?

19:43.110 --> 19:45.650
It's something only you can do, Amane-kun.

19:47.260 --> 19:49.230
Please look at me more.

19:52.760 --> 19:54.150
Yeah, because I made a promise.

19:54.150 --> 19:56.920
Yes, you did promise me that.

19:57.870 --> 20:01.170
So I don't think I need to make 
such a fuss about it anymore.

20:02.130 --> 20:06.120
I'm not going to consciously change 
my behavior at school yet,

20:06.120 --> 20:08.680
but I won't work so hard 
to act proper, either.

20:10.000 --> 20:10.930
Okay.

20:11.550 --> 20:13.940
Why does it seem like you're disappointed?

20:14.280 --> 20:19.580
O-Oh, no, I'm glad you started thinking 
that way, Mahiru. I think it's a good thing.

20:19.580 --> 20:20.820
I think it's a good thing.

20:21.570 --> 20:25.320
But it just made me think about something.

20:25.980 --> 20:28.870
What is it? Go ahead and tell me.

20:28.870 --> 20:30.370
No, it's just...

20:30.370 --> 20:32.840
I won't get mad at you.

20:32.840 --> 20:37.290
I don't think you would intentionally 
say something to upset me anyway.

20:38.800 --> 20:42.190
Just... D-Don't laugh, okay?

20:43.120 --> 20:45.080
You said you won't make such a fuss anymore?

20:45.080 --> 20:46.010
Yes.

20:46.010 --> 20:51.310
So sooner or later, the other guys 
might start to see what you're really like.

20:51.920 --> 20:54.260
I don't know how I feel about that.

20:55.330 --> 21:00.020
You're probably thinking, "this guy 
has some nerve saying that," right?

21:04.290 --> 21:07.280
You know, you're really cute, Amane-kun.

21:07.280 --> 21:08.700
Oh, come on.

21:08.700 --> 21:11.540
What part of me is cute? 
How can you say that to a guy like me?

21:11.540 --> 21:13.290
Every bit of you is cute.

21:13.610 --> 21:15.290
Don't you mean "cool"?

21:15.750 --> 21:17.290
Yes, you're cool.

21:17.290 --> 21:21.460
You are definitely cute, 
but you're also cool.

21:21.460 --> 21:23.110
The coolest person I know.

21:23.110 --> 21:26.550
Fine, enough! I get it. I get it already!

21:27.630 --> 21:30.050
See? That's what I mean by "cute."

21:30.050 --> 21:32.520
If you say it again, 
I'll shut your mouth for you.

21:32.520 --> 21:33.510
Oh? And how?

21:33.510 --> 21:35.810
How? With my hand.

21:36.180 --> 21:39.230
Now that doesn't scare me even a little bit.

21:39.590 --> 21:42.980
Even if you don't think you are,

21:43.300 --> 21:46.990
to me you're really cool, Amane-kun.

21:47.300 --> 21:51.060
I see someone very special in you.

21:52.340 --> 21:53.850
Someone very cute.

22:00.630 --> 22:05.010
The Angel Next Door
Spoils Me Rotten

22:05.390 --> 22:07.840
<i>Outer space is huge</i>

22:07.840 --> 22:10.240
<i>But only one of these planets</i>

22:10.240 --> 22:12.540
<i>Is our own blue planet, Earth</i>

22:12.540 --> 22:14.930
<i>And in that huge world</i>

22:14.930 --> 22:17.310
<i>A little message of love</i>

22:17.310 --> 22:19.650
<i>Is on its way to you</i>

22:19.650 --> 22:21.930
<i>Trying to make its way</i>

22:21.930 --> 22:24.840
<i>To you on that little island</i>

22:25.410 --> 22:27.790
<i>Ever since we first met</i>

22:27.790 --> 22:30.110
<i>There's a lot we've been through</i>

22:30.110 --> 22:32.560
<i>All these feelings I have</i>

22:32.560 --> 22:34.950
<i>Keep filling more letters, too</i>

22:34.950 --> 22:37.290
<i>Before you know it</i>

22:37.290 --> 22:39.580
<i>We’ll be singing together</i>

22:39.580 --> 22:41.900
<i>Sometimes powerful</i>

22:41.900 --> 22:44.220
<i>Sometimes heartbreaking</i>

22:44.220 --> 22:46.670
<i>When that song starts ringing out</i>

22:46.670 --> 22:49.050
<i>It will be heard far away</i>

22:49.050 --> 22:51.390
<i>And that sweet song</i>

22:51.390 --> 22:57.270
<i>Will change the world</i>

22:57.270 --> 23:01.070
<i>Listen, the one person</i>

23:01.070 --> 23:03.360
<i>Who's dearest to you</i>

23:03.360 --> 23:06.690
<i>Is right next to you</i>

23:06.690 --> 23:10.430
<i>I just want to send this your way</i>

23:10.430 --> 23:12.780
<i>I'm hoping it will reach</i>

23:12.780 --> 23:16.120
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:16.120 --> 23:20.620
<i>Listen</i>

23:20.620 --> 23:25.420
<i>Listen</i>

23:25.420 --> 23:30.470
<i>Listen</i>

23:30.470 --> 23:34.200
<i>Please hear my love song</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
Next Time

23:35.300 --> 23:39.980
Say Goodbye to My Cowardice
